      "body": "<p>Hello,</p>\n<p>Your one-time password is: <strong>{OTP}</strong></p>\n<p><i>If you didn't ask for the one-time password, you can ignore this email.</i></p>\n<p>\n  Thanks,<br/>\n  {APP_NAME} team\n</p>"
